# Inti authoring toolbar - Slice B1 visible clickable author buttons witness.
# Buttons are sugar over commands: each button binds a replayable BGE command.
# The same game is still fully constructible from commands alone.
plugin import-set inti-chasqui
author start inti-toolbar
author archetype inti-runner
author group maps
author bind background maps/machu-picchu.intimap
author group paths
author button add place-node
author button bind place-node author place 0.50 0.50 new-node
author button add link-path
author button bind link-path author link hut-of-the-caretaker sun-gate
author group triggers
author button add add-shot
author button bind add-shot author trigger sun-gate photo-claimed open-area-exit
author group ui
author button add ui-dots
author button bind ui-dots inti ui-group dots
author button add start-run
author button bind start-run inti photo-run
author button show
author save inti-toolbar
